Write a query to to get the list of users who took the a training lesson more than once in the same day

user_id  username      training_id  training_date	count
4        Lisa Romero   2            August, 04 2015    	2
4        Lisa Romero   3            August, 03 2015	2
1        John Doe      1            August, 02 2015	3
3        Alice Jones   2            August, 02 2015	2


select t.user_id, u.username, t.training_id, t.training_date, count(*)
from users u
join training_details t
on t.user_id = u.user_id
group by t.user_id, u.username, t.training_id, t.training_date
having count(*) > 1;
